The '''2022 Harlow District Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Harlow District Council]] in [[Essex]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.harlow.gov.uk/sites/default/files/documents/Notice%20of%20election%20-%20local%20elections%20May%202022.pdf|title=Notice of Election|access-date=7 May 2022|work=Harlow District Council|date=23 March 2022}}</ref>  This was on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]].

